[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2995254621","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107843#issuecomment-2995254621","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107843","id":2995254621,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6yh_Vd","user":{"login":"groud","id":6093119,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwOTMxMTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6093119?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud","html_url":"https://github.com/groud","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-23T07:27:01Z","updated_at":"2025-06-23T07:27:01Z","body":"Removed the \"bug\" label as this is the intended behavior.\r\n\r\nI am not sure about this change, I'd like the proposal to be backed a bit more, as the other tools can be useful even if the TileMap editor is visible. Those other tools are more specific than the \"select\" one, which make me think when you change to them, then you know what you are doing and expect them to work right away.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2995254621/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2995390658","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107843#issuecomment-2995390658","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107843","id":2995390658,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6yigjC","user":{"login":"DexterFstone","id":92402263,"node_id":"U_kgDOBYHyVw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92402263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DexterFstone","html_url":"https://github.com/DexterFstone","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DexterFstone/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DexterFstone/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DexterFstone/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DexterFstone/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DexterFstone/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DexterFstone/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DexterFstone/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DexterFstone/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DexterFstone/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-23T08:09:46Z","updated_at":"2025-06-23T08:13:30Z","body":"> I am not sure about this change, I'd like the proposal to be backed a bit more, as the other tools can be useful even if the TileMap editor is visible. Those other tools are more specific than the \"select\" one, which make me think when you change to them, then you know what you are doing and expect them to work right away.\r\n\r\nThe scenario I was considering was this:\r\nThe user has selected a tool other than the `select tool`\r\nNow the user selects the `TileMapLayer` node and wants to start painting with the default tool, but since the selection tool is not a `select`, it is having trouble\r\nI think the best place to edit the tool selection was when the `TileMapEditor` is displayed\r\nAfter that, if needed, the user can select their own tool, such as `rotate` or `scale`","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2995390658/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2995419050","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107843#issuecomment-2995419050","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107843","id":2995419050,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6yineq","user":{"login":"groud","id":6093119,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwOTMxMTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6093119?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud","html_url":"https://github.com/groud","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-23T08:19:09Z","updated_at":"2025-06-23T08:23:20Z","body":"hmm. I guess it makes sense then. If it still allows you to use the tools afterward I guess it could work. \r\n\r\nI wonder if it's still good though, there might be some users who you like, for example, the \"move\" tool to stay active when selecting nodes one after the other in the scene tree. And the fact we would introduce this new behavior (about selecting a node possibly auto-switching the tool) might be a bit confusing and annoying for some.\r\n\r\nThat being said, switching to select mode when clicking a tool in the tilemap bottom toolbar makes perfect sense. I think it might deserve either a dedicated function though, or simply `_update_toolbar` to be renamed to something like `_tool_button_pressed` (so that's it's a bit clearer it does now more than update the toolbar).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2995419050/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3007823432","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107843#issuecomment-3007823432","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107843","id":3007823432,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6zR75I","user":{"login":"DexterFstone","id":92402263,"node_id":"U_kgDOBYHyVw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92402263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DexterFstone","html_url":"https://github.com/DexterFstone","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DexterFstone/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DexterFstone/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DexterFstone/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DexterFstone/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DexterFstone/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DexterFstone/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DexterFstone/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DexterFstone/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DexterFstone/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-26T09:28:58Z","updated_at":"2025-06-26T09:38:18Z","body":"I updated the code, now it should be cleaner and work better. Additionally, it keeps track of the previously selected tool, so whenever `TileMapLayerEditor` is unavailable, the tool will revert to its original state.\r\n- When selecting `TileMapLayer`, it forces the `CanvasItemEditor` to select the `Select` tool.\r\n- When the mouse enters the `TileMapLayerEditor`, it forces the `CanvasItemEditor` to select the `Select` tool.\r\n- When selecting the `TileMapLayerEditor` tools, it forces the `CanvasItemEditor` to select the `Select` tool.\r\n- When deselecting the `TileMapLayer`, it forces the `CanvasItemEditor` to revert to the previous tool.\r\n\r\n> [!NOTE]\r\n> In my tests, the mouse entered does not always work","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3007823432/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3015178150","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107843#issuecomment-3015178150","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107843","id":3015178150,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6zt_em","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"htt